      "catalog_number": "VOLTA078",
      "desc": "Gabriel Moraes delivers two fast, groove-led techno cuts built around vocals that shape the identity of each track.\\n\\n\"Impulse\" pairs a haunting female vocal with distorted synth lines that respond to the lyrics, creating a tense and hypnotic atmosphere.\\n\\n\"Your Voice\" takes a darker approach, driven by a deep vocal that almost becomes another synth within the track. Its low tone locks into the rhythm, adding weight and movement to the chunky groove.\\n\\nTogether, the two tracks form a powerful, vocal-driven techno EP made for the dance floor.",
