      "catalog_number": "VOLTA075",
      "desc": "Khainz revisits Alex Stein & Victor Ruiz's iconic \"New Generation\" with a remix rooted in nearly two decades of friendship. After first meeting Victor in Brazil in 2009 and sharing stages around the world with both artists over the years, Khainz set out to reimagine a track that had long been a staple in his DJ sets. Three years and five versions later, the remix stays true to the original's driving groove while adding Khainz's unmistakable touch, delivering a fresh take that feels both timeless and deeply personal.",
